# Modern Vyapari does NOT read API keys from environment variables.
#
# All keys (Revolut X, Anthropic, Browserbase, Telegram) are entered in the app's
# onboarding / Settings screens and stored encrypted with your OS keychain via
# Electron safeStorage. They never touch disk in plaintext.
#
# This file exists so nobody is tempted to create a .env full of secrets.
# .env and .env.* are gitignored regardless.
